            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## WaveType is now WaveVoice

Same app, new name. Your dictations, voice notes, meetings, downloaded models and macOS permissions are kept.

## Licenses

- **15-day free trial** with every feature.
- After that, a **one-time purchase**: plans for **1 Mac** or **3 Macs**. Activate your key in **Settings → License**.
- When the trial ends, everything you saved stays available to view, copy and export. A license is only needed to record and transcribe.
- Free up a Mac anytime from the app or the customer portal.
]]></description>
